(The Infinity Well project demonstrates) Tj
T* (light reflection through an engaging) Tj
T* (visual illusion of infinite depth. Using) Tj
T* (two mirrors—one fully reflective and) Tj
T* (one partially reflective—and) Tj
T* (strategically placed LEDs, the model) Tj
T* (creates the appearance of an endless) Tj
T* (tunnel as light bounces repeatedly) Tj
T* (between the surfaces. This hands-on) Tj
T* (experiment teaches principles of light) Tj
T* (propagation, reflection, and diminishing) Tj
T* (intensity while showcasing practical) Tj
T* (applications in art and design. A) Tj
T* (creative way to explore optics, the) Tj
T* (project bridges scientific concepts with) Tj
T* (striking visual phenomena.) Tj
